<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us | PES Sports</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Raleway:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    * { font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif; }
    .stat-card { border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:28px 20px; text-align:center; }
    .stat-card.dark { background:#111; color:#fff; border-color:#111; }
    .stat-icon { width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 14px; background:#f3f4f6; }
    .stat-card.dark .stat-icon { background:#1f1f1f; }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-gray-900">

<%- include('../partials/user/header.ejs', { page: 'about' }) %>

<main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-14">

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start mb-20">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">Our Story</h1>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        <p>
          At PES Sports, we believe every player deserves the gear that fuels confidence
          and performance. The right pair of boots is more than equipment — it's a
          reflection of passion, ambition, and the drive to stand out on the pitch.
        </p>
        <p>
          Born from a love for the game, PES Sports is your destination for boots
          inspired by football's greatest moments and players. Whether you're competing
          in matches, training hard, or playing casually with friends, we offer boots
          designed to match every playing style.
        </p>
        <p>
          What makes PES Sports special? Inspiration meets performance. Our collection
          brings you boots influenced by legendary players and iconic moments, helping
          you step onto the field with confidence while creating your own story.
        </p>
        <p>
          From premium materials to performance-focused designs, every pair is selected
          to deliver comfort, durability, and control. Whether it's match day or
          practice, our boots are made to support every move you make.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900">
          Welcome to PES Sports — where every step brings you closer to playing like
          your hero.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
      <img
        src="/img/Toni kroos (1).jpg"
        alt="PES Sports"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        onerror="this.src='/images/default-banner.png'"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <div class="stat-card dark">
      <div class="stat-icon">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v10M9 9.5c0-1.1 1.34-2 3-2s3 .9 3 2-1.34 2-3 2-3 .9-3 2 1.34 2 3 2 3-.9 3-2"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' ? stats.monthlySales : '33k' %></p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-1">Monthly Product Sale</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-icon">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#111" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M3 8h18M12 8V4M8 4h8"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' ? stats.activeCustomers : '45.5k' %></p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Customer active in our site</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stat-card dark">
      <div class="stat-icon">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v2H5l-1 12h16L19 9h-2V7a5 5 0 0 0-5-5Z"/><path d="M9 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold"><%= typeof stats !== 'undefined' ? stats.annualSales : '25k' %></p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 mt-1">Anual gross sale in our site</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</main>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer.ejs') %>

</body>
</html>
